INSERT INTO `fbs_lcss_admin_evaluation` (`evaluation_aid`, `evaluation_list_id`, `evaluation_trainee_email`, `evaluation_trainee_ratings`, `evaluation_question_most`, `evaluation_question_least`, `evaluation_question_improve`, `evaluation_question_others`, `evaluation_created`) VALUES
(37, '1', 'camilledonatos0814@gmail.com', '100', 'The most motivating and enjoyable part of the program was how much trust it promoted in its students. It promoted a sense of transparency, where students were encouraged to be open and honest even with their doubts and concerns. With this, the program was able to create an environment in which all participants felt comfortable.\nThe Frontline Business Solution OJT PROGRAM had a whole lot of great things to offer. But when I look back at the program from my perspective, it was more than just the lessons learned or skills gained that makes me proud. It&#39;s also what I learned about myself as a person that makes me proud to have been part of this OJT PROGRAM, for here I discovered some pretty important things about myself that maybe I would have never known or experienced if not for this program.', '.', 'For me there is nothing more to improve through this OJT PROGRAM but I learned so much from it, both personally and professionally. The OJT PROGRAM was a great experience, the content was very relevant to the business world and interactive learning ensured that everyone stayed focused on what was being taught.\n', 'Interestingly enough, what I found most helpful about this OJT PROGRAM was how issues were addressed with a lot of love and understanding while still maintaining standards. This was greatly reflected in the staff, who were very approachable, understanding and non-judgmental. In fact, they really took the time to know us more as individuals.\nI felt that overall, this program was a success. It met all its objectives (i.e., imparting practical business knowledge and skills), it surpassed my expectations and it has motivated me to further pursue my studies in the related field of management.', '2022-09-05'),
(38, '1', 'ronilynvalencia15@gmail.com', '100', 'What I liked most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM was the super-specific ojt in my course. It&#39;s very helpful for my future job. Another thing I liked was that mentors or coaches were too sceptical and focused on ojt. They didn&#39;t let us get on with the project and they really wanted us to learn.', 'I didn&#39;t like anything about FBS OJT PROGRAM because I learned so much as a trainee.', 'The suggestions I want to make to improve the future FBS OJT PROGRAM are nonetheless. Because I think they are doing enough for the trainees.', 'I want to thank to FBS Human Resource Manager &#39;Mam Rhoda Beloso&#39; and to FBS Operations Manager &#39;Sir Ralph Acoba&#39;.\n\nBig thanks to our mentor and coaches &#39;Sir Roy’, &#39;Sir Ansbert&#39;, and &#39;Sir Mark&#39;.\n\nBig thanks also to our personal leadership effectiveness coaches &#39;Sir Jhonny&#39;, &#39;Mam Kennie&#39;, &#39;Sir Virgil&#39;, &#39;Mam Drheanz&#39;, &#39;Sir Michael&#39;, &#39;Mam Mary Grace&#39;, &#39;Mam Ronica&#39;, &#39;Sir Ivan&#39;, &#39;Mam Charlene&#39;, and &#39;Mam Jesselyn&#39;. All the topics helped, make myself better.\n\nAs a trainee, we greatly appreciate all your patience, efforts and sacrifices for us.\n\nThank you FBS Family! God bless you all!', '2022-09-05'),
(39, '1', 'jcarlo.acupan@gmail.com', '100', 'Our Trainors', 'Maybe the photo taking ????', 'I really don&#39;t know, for me it&#39;s perfect ', 'Thank you all, we&#39;re gonna miss you ????', '2023-01-04'),
(40, '1', 'melissacasapao915@gmail.com', '100', 'everything po. starting with the tasks that sir gives us. also the PLE\n', 'none', 'Absolutely nothing po Their training is excellent for me.', 'I am grateful to FBS for allowing me to learn so much from Sir Ansbert, Sir Roy, and Sir MC, and I wish that more Wonder Tours.', '2023-01-04'),
(41, '1', 'nathandoria07@gmail.com', '100', 'What I like most about FBS OJT Program is the trainers because their explanations are very clear and you can learn alot from them. They are also friendly and easy to talk to.', 'None', 'None', 'None', '2023-01-09'),
(42, '1', 'paulquiliope0625@gmail.com', '100', 'what I like the most is their attentiveness in their trainees whenever there is someone who is having a hard time in a certain topic.', 'there are no things that I like the least about the FBS OJT PROGRAM, everything that I have experienced are all positive things, from their environment, their instructors and other employees and they do not make the trainees feel that they are out of place.', 'the suggestions that I would like to make is to teach other website languages that are available in the internet in order to broaden the knowledge of the trainees, and also the instructors and other employees', 'None', '2023-01-09'),
(43, '1', 'aileeah2219lozada@gmail.com', '100', 'The FBS OJT program&#39;s staff, who have consistently shown consideration for their trainees, is what I like most about it. I enjoy the atmosphere in the office, which gives the feeling that everyone gets along with one another rather than working as separate individuals.', 'My least favorite part of the program, on the other hand, is that I couldn&#39;t finish it because of a scheduling conflict with our schedules and activities at school.', 'Whenever trainees feel pressured and tired, instructors should lead icebreaker exercises.', 'none', '2023-01-09'),
(44, '1', 'jayveecalalo123@gmail.com', '73.33', 'i dont know about it because it&#39;s my first time ', 'I don&#39;t know about it', 'to increase our technology i guess', 'none', '2023-03-05'),
(45, '1', 'marcospencerguino.tmlcr@gmail.com', '100', 'Web Developing projects especially Javascripts and SASS.', 'I love everything about the program and the only problem is the restroom. :D', 'I think adding an assistant for the class would make the teaching a lot easier for the professors but all in all, everything is perfect.', 'Thank you for the knowledge that you shared with us. Masasabi kong sulit ang 162 hours ko po dito sa FBS. Maraming marami pong salamat.', '2023-03-15'),
(46, '1', 'reggieguerra.tmlcr@gmail.com', '100', 'The exercise in the FBS program was something I loved since, although being under pressure to complete it, I still found it enjoyable. \nPati po yung devotion in every monday  kasi kaming mga student minsan hindi na makapag simba.', 'none', 'Mag karoon ng assistant ang prof. para sa mga tanong ng student , para matutukan lahat ng OJT.', 'Thank you for guiding us.\nnaging masaya po ako sa pag OOJT ko po dto sa FBS.', '2023-03-15'),
(47, '1', 'jaysonfortus.tmlcr@gmail.com', '100', 'what I liked the most here was how the trainers treated us and how they teach.', 'NONE', 'more traineers to guide more students', 'NONE', '2023-03-15'),
(48, '1', 'lancenarvaez.tmlcr@gmail.com', '97.78', 'yung pakikisama at pag turo samin ng may pasensya na kahit na ilang week nakami nakapasok tulad ko hirap parin pero steel nanjan padin si sir abet to guide me thank you!', 'none', 'i would like to extend the cup, but the money is still short and I cant say anything else about the management but its very good!', 'none', '2023-03-15'),
(49, '1', 'vincecenteno.tmlcr@gmail.com', '100', 'What I enjoy the most about the program is how applicable it is to my course and possible job.', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'The output should be graded, and this is a good habit. It creates a friendly competition, which in my opinion helps the trainees advance further. Those who are falling behind will be aware of their deficiencies, and there is a possibility that this will wake them up to take steps to improve themselves.', '2023-03-15'),
(50, '1', 'rothecconsebido@gmail.com', '97.78', 'The teachers are easy to get along', 'It&#39;s online', 'I think face to face OJT is better than online.', 'None', '2023-03-16'),
(51, '1', 'nicajoycatipon@gmail.com', '84.44', 'The trainers performance', 'My Internet Connection', 'none', 'none', '2023-03-16'),
(52, '1', 'espiritujohnaeron0@gmail.com', '88.89', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', '2023-03-16'),
(53, '1', 'bolanoearl4@gmail.com', '91.11', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', '2023-03-16'),
(54, '1', 'jairusbacsa0310@gmail.com', '93.33', 'The instructors and the activities they give to us', 'We didn&#39;t experience face-to-face learning because we didn&#39;t make it in the slots', 'Having more slots for the students who will be taking OJT program at FBS', 'None', '2023-03-16'),
(55, '1', 'Jamesenador@gmail.com', '88.89', 'almost everything', 'nothing', 'to slow down a bit its hard to catch up or to understand a certain topic that bieng disscused', 'thank you for teaching me', '2023-03-16'),
(56, '1', '1119jchrnndz@gmail.com', '82.22', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', '2023-03-16'),
(57, '1', 'rainnielcapid3@gmail.com', '88.89', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', '2023-03-16'),
(58, '1', 'mhartinjhamaltolentino21@gmail.com', '86.67', 'The program teaches HTML fast and effectively\nbetter than what they taught in high school', 'The instructor for our 2nd week kinda talked fast and it was hard following up', 'none', 'none', '2023-03-16'),
(59, '1', 'dhanateng25@gmail.com', '86.67', 'coding', 'i like the teaching of our suitor bacause i learn how to create web design', 'don&#39;t stop teaching because all of teachers are good.', 'enhance your teaching about making web development', '2023-03-16'),
(60, '1', 'aliazasmk@gmail.com', '82.22', 'I like the instructors, you can ask questions to them anytime you had a problem', 'The grades, my first rating wasn&#39;t fair because I did finish my work on time and I only got 84% on it.', 'Be considerate, because the day 5 of the OJT Program I have a problem with my internet connection of course I can&#39;t submit my works and my friend told Mr. Plaza to please excuse me but my grades were still 60, I don&#39;t know if I can still submit my work at this moment.', 'Overall all I can say is the instructors were good but I like Mr. Yamon the most cause he always helps us and gives us high grades XD ', '2023-03-16'),
(61, '1', 'ellainesky.ellaine@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the way our instructors teach us. I get to learn a lot from them.', 'I think the duration of each activity was pretty fast since I&#39;m still familiarizing myself with web development.', 'I would be happy if the available slot for the face-to-face program increased.', 'Thank you for giving me the opportunity to learn and enjoy making websites.', '2023-03-16'),
(62, '1', 'errolfaylon@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the environment and how the instructors took their time to help us whenever we encounter a problem relating to the training/activity.', 'I guess sometimes the instructors are too fast for others to keep up, although the fault comes to the students who doesn&#39;t speak up and ask for help or instructions.', 'I don&#39;t have any suggestions so far since I never think that the program is lacking anything.', 'Hoping to at least have a chance to be accepted when the time comes when I try to applied for an OJT Program during my college year in hopes to be able to learn more in web designing and more.', '2023-03-16'),
(63, '1', 'jrviaro48@gmail.com', '97.78', 'I LIKED HOW THEY TEACH US TO DO THE HTML AND CSS', 'I LIKE EVERYTHING THEY TAUGHT.', 'MORE STUDENTS TO APPLY ON THEIR PROGRAM TO LEARN MORE ABOUT PROGRAMMING.', 'I WOULD LIKE TO THANK EVERY TEACHER THAT TEACH US  AND THIS OJT HELPED EVERY STUDENTS TO UNDERSTAND AND GAIN MORE KNOWLEDGES ABOUT  PROGRAMMING.', '2023-03-16'),
(64, '1', 'dandavidbrinosa4@gmail.com', '71.11', 'Learning new things or tricks about html', 'The setup, i don&#39;t expect that this ojt will be online but i do learn many things', '-', 'Thank you for the new skills that i learned in just 10 days of working with you trainers!', '2023-03-16'),
(65, '1', 'josephanlacan2@gmail.com', '97.78', 'they teach us well', 'nothing', 'be properly', 'I learned a lot and improved my coding skills', '2023-03-16'),
(66, '1', 'micaalinea0803@gmail.com', '100', 'I think I like all the projects we did', 'None, because all the projects were taught well', 'Maybe more webpage designs', 'You can really learn something from the teachers here because they teach everything to you and help you with  the problems in your system', '2023-03-16'),
(67, '1', 'rphlvillaverde@gmail.com', '64.44', 'the patience of instructors ', 'the instructors coding too fast, that most can barely keep up. \n\n', '1.tone down the speed of coding\n2.before writing new blocks/lines of code, explain first what is being added/changed, also explain the keywords being used \n (not saying its not being done, more like, mas madalas na di namin alam ung tinatype namin or kailangan i-type)\n3. website issues and bugs\n', 'the instructors were nice and it felt like we could go to them for help comfortably, marami lang talaga nahihiya kasi ayaw nila mag mukhang di maalam kahit sobrang iwan na sa code. medyo mahirap lang talaga sabayan minsan kasi medyo nakakalito kasii,  foreign ung field ng web development saamin\nbut other than the things said above. for me, i think i learned alot, i was forced to keep up and adapt because of the situation, \nhaving experience in web development is also a good extra skill to learn so i thank all the instructors for giving their best in teaching us and showing us how things are done, and lastly. this was an interesting experience for me, which i am grateful for, despite the complications :)', '2023-03-16'),
(68, '1', 'charleseneria@gmail.com', '100', 'what i like the most about the fbs ojt program is their teaching, they help us and teach us to do things that we don&#39;t know yet. The teachers are approachable on the meeting too.', 'maybe the pace, a little bit faster.', 'I don&#39;t have a suggestion because as of the moment, I think, it is already a great company for learners like us.', 'Thank you FBS for the experience!', '2023-03-16'),
(69, '1', 'meranamargareth@gmail.com', '95.56', 'learning coding', 'none', 'To improve the practicum program are additional seminars and training to make it more hands on for the students to learn more.', 'none', '2023-03-16'),
(70, '1', 'jurispanganiban@gmail.com', '64.44', 'There were multiple projects to learn and the teacher was very accomodating in terms of trying to help you debug ur code.', 'The online setting is not very fun combined with the early schedule.', 'Change the clock in times and have more interactive learning', 'Emmanuel Manalo good teacher yes', '2023-03-16'),
(71, '1', 'sajoldessamae@gmail.com', '100', 'i liked everything we did', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2023-03-16'),
(72, '1', 'cheenylaine13@gmail.com', '93.33', 'It is an opportunity offered by companies to train students that have a potential on being a new employee in the future', 'none', 'Making a positive impact within your local community can benefit your company in a variety of ways.\n', 'none', '2023-03-16'),
(73, '1', 'hanygruezo@gmail.com', '91.11', 'What I like the most about this program is that it has taught me a lot about web development and has given me experience of work. I like how the instructors do the best they can to help us trainees when there is a problem.', 'What I liked the least was that instructors are sometimes fast with what they are teaching but they do adjust it once we tell them that we can&#39;t keep up. So it is not really a big problem for me.', 'Double-checking links or systems to prevent loss of time.', 'None', '2023-03-16'),
(74, '1', 'papajohnkyle92@gmail.com', '86.67', 'ang nagustuhan ko dito ay yung magka meron ng experience sa isang kumpanya at kung paano ito patakbuhin', ' ', ' ', 'Thank you for the trainers.', '2023-03-16'),
(75, '1', 'rosendoblatade@gmail.com', '62.22', 'I think Magagaling mag code ', 'None', 'Medyo bagalan lang po sa pagtuturong code hinde po kase makasunod yung iba ', 'None', '2023-03-16'),
(76, '1', 'joshuatalavera07011@gmail.com', '66.67', 'what I liked most about them was being a kind instructor and not putting too much pressure on their students when doing or creating projects', 'When the instructors getting annoyed or pissed when their students ask a lot about the project', 'Try to not rush things when teaching a student so the student can easy understand everything', 'None', '2023-03-16'),
(77, '1', 'kennetharaojo300@gmail.com', '93.33', ' ', ' ', ' ', ' ', '2023-03-17'),
(78, '1', 'Daniloalimagno75@gmail.com', '82.22', 'We&#39;ll learn how to coding', 'They&#39;re the ones who teach us how to learn', 'All the computers are equipped with a computer or laptop.', 'Thank you for teaching us', '2023-03-17'),
(79, '1', 'johnatanacio2004@gmail.com', '100', 'The way of teaching ', 'High paced teaching which results in me not being able to keep up. But it may be high paced the way of teching and how professional they are at it is a good thing.', 'I don’t feel like there is anything missing in the ojt program exept the high paced teaching.', 'I dont have anymore to say ', '2023-03-17'),
(80, '1', 'sumi_yamamoto@yahoo.com', '100', 'What I like during my On-the-job training in FBS is that when it comes to teaching and training there&#39;s no difference whether you are on-site or work-from-home. I really learned a lot in FBS&#39; OJT program and I can say that I do &#34;know&#34; how to code properly because I now understand how each elements or functions work unlike before when I don&#39;t have any trainings yet. And everyone in the company are so kind to us and they treat us like we&#39;re also part of the family, and like a real employee. I really like and appreciate it a lot because I experienced how or what is work in reality. ', 'So far there is nothing that I liked the least. The trainings are strictly based on your time, so if your training period is short then it is understandable that you won&#39;t get to learn the next part.', 'I hope that many people, students/learners as well, to discover and know what FBS&#39; OJT program (or the company rather) is, because you will really learn from them. And hoping that the company will have more learning facilities and instructors in the near future, so that they could accomodate many  trainees and many people will learn from them and become just like them. ', 'Other than one of the best companies, really inspiring! Thank you for giving us the opportunity to learn from everyone.  ', '2023-03-23'),
(81, '1', 'joshua.maxime11@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the processes and procedures your trainers used in order for me to understand the lessons easier.', 'none', 'None. The program you are offering now has exceeded my expectations and I don&#39;t think you still need to improve your program but you just need to be consistent in providing quality education for the future generations.', 'none', '2023-04-03'),
(82, '1', 'mjvilarmino@gmail.com', '97.78', 'What I like the most about the FBS OJT Program is the relentless coaching and teaching from our instructors Sir Roy and Sir Mc. Their hands-on approach makes our learning a lot more fun and effective. Additionally, the FBS also holds a PLE once a week that emphasizes the value of character and personality development in both our personal and professional lives. Overall, FBS allows its trainees to acquire not only the technical skills required in the industry but also the character traits and life skills necessary to be successful in all aspects of our lives. ', 'The only thing that I like the least about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is the limited amount of time I can participate since I only have 240 hours. ', 'I have no suggestions. The knowledge and experience I have gained from participating in the FBS OJT PROGRAM have been valuable, so I think the strategy used by the FBS to conduct its OJT program is already effective and will undoubtedly help trainees improve their skills as well as their outlook on life. ', 'Wish  I could meet my instructors in Laguna and personally thank them for their guidance and patience. ', '2023-04-11'),
(83, '1', '0318-1190@lspu.edu.ph', '95.56', 'in this FBS OJT programs can be beneficial for employees because they allow individuals to have experience and practical skills in their field of work. These programs often provide opportunities for employees to learn from experienced professionals and to apply their knowledge in real-world situations, which can help them to develop confidence and expertise in their work. ', 'in this FBS OJT PROGRAM have a limited interaction: Fast teaching may prioritize the delivery of information over discussion and interaction, which can limit opportunities for students to ask questions, share ideas, and collaborate with their peers.', 'in this FBS OJT PROGRAM I suggest add more trainer to handle all trainee in web development Active and practical learning, The best way for trainees to learn is by actively participating in practical exercises and projects. OJT programs should incorporate hands-on experiences and give trainees the opportunity to apply the skills they have learned ', 'N/A', '2023-04-13'),
(84, '1', 'joshbanaag22@gmail.com', '95.56', 'Ang pinaka nagustuhan ko po sa FBS OJT PROGRAM ay mas pinalawak po lalo ang kaalaman ko tungkol VIRTUAL STUDIO nalaman ko din po ang pag design gamit ang FIGMA at yung mga prof po or mentor po namin mababait at talagang tutulungan ka na maitindihan mo yung pinapagawa. Hinanda po talaga kami sa tatahakin namin 2-3 years from now. Sobrang laking tulong po nito sa amin. ', 'Wala po kasi habang nag OOJT po ako okay naman po lahat at masaya po ako sa lahat', 'Wala po kasi po ang naranasan ko po during FBS OJT PROGRAM ay maayos naman po lahat.', 'Wala naman po, Thankyou po FBS sa lahat!', '2023-04-14'),
(85, '1', 'harveylibit@gmail.com', '100', ' What I like the most about our training in FBS is that during our face-to-face training, they always check on us to see if we are still keeping up with the topic. And also, it is difficult for us to keep up during our online training, but our trainees guarantee us that whether it is online or face-to-face, they can teach us and we can still understand the topics.', 'During my training days in FBS, I don&#39;t have any dislikes because I enjoy staying with the company and making new friends with my fellow trainees. And when it comes to academic purposes, I don&#39;t have any dislikes since our trainers show how dedicated they are to their work.', 'There are no more suggestions for FBS.', 'There are no more suggestions or comments for FBS. Since I enjoy and learn a lot from the company.', '2023-04-17'),
(86, '1', 'bethmitra18@gmail.com', '95.56', 'The free coffee and the friendship that we made in the office.', 'None. Because FBS is the best.', 'No activity. ', 'Thankyou for teaching us.', '2023-04-17'),
(87, '1', 'prinsamsaman@gmail.com', '86.67', 'The environment as well as the trainers.', 'The schedule because for me it is too early but  it&#39;s just a matter of time management on my behalf.', 'I wouldn&#39;t suggest anything because for me it was a nice experience.', 'I would like to say thank you for the entire FBS for acknowledging me even if I don&#39;t have an experience when it comes to web development.', '2023-04-20'),
(88, '1', 'lesleyjoshlimbo@gmail.com', '86.67', 'The environment and the trainers approach of mentoring.', 'The least I like was the time schedule because for me its too early, but its just a matter of time management on my behalf.', 'I don&#39;t have any suggestion on the OJT program of FBS.', 'I just want to thank all the staff of FBS for accommodating me through the entire OJT program, THANK YOU FBS ', '2023-04-24'),
(89, '1', 'feraldojancloe@gmail.com', '71.11', 'I like the most is the way they teach the students, at first it&#39;s a bit awkward, but day by day it&#39;s getting more comfortable to learn.', 'In my 10 days learning online, I think it&#39;s not having a fix schedule.', 'I don&#39;t really have any suggestion, just the schedule.', 'N/A', '2023-04-25'),
(90, '1', 'althealat21@gmail.com', '95.56', 'When we do writing emails for the client and doing the excel.', 'When we do the accounting in excel. It is hard for me because I can&#39;t follow the instruction fast.', 'Nothing. FBS OJT PROGRAM is perfect.', 'Thank you very much, FBS! I will miss you a lot. Thank you for this opportunity. I learned a lot.', '2023-04-27'),
(91, '1', 'andreyyyempemano@gmail.com', '100', 'Being a part of FBS company even if I&#39;m a trainee they treat like a real employee in fbs', 'N/A, everything&#39;s great', 'Focus more on the student like treating them like a their are in a real job in the company ', 'n/A', '2023-05-12'),
(92, '1', 'ruckusdestroys29@gmail.com', '100', 'Everything', 'None at all', 'add Backend tutorial', 'none', '2023-05-12'),
(93, '1', 'jaguilar28.ja@gmail.com', '100', 'All of the topics that are tackled during the OJT including all scripting languages for HTML.', 'Cancelled fellowship. It&#39;s an opportunity to meet all the instructors and other OJT trainees personally. ', 'None so far.', 'It&#39;s a great opportunity to be a part of Frontline Business Solutions for 3 months. I have learned so much about scripting language and for the discussions of Mr. Jhonny Dichoso. Looking forward for the next time that I&#39;m able to learn more about front-end development. I really thank FBS so much for the best opportunity, it even helped me a lot to boost my confidence to improve myself more about the field. Thank you so much, FBS!', '2023-05-23'),
(94, '1', 'frenzjonathan.alulod@g.batstate-u.edu.ph', '100', 'What I like the most about spending our OJT Training here in FBS, Frontline Business Solutions is that we have learned everything that is related to our IT Skills, industry related scenarios and settings and the personality development that we must acquire and be broaden to further nurture the needs to cope up with the office and industry settings. Another thing is that we are properly guided with utmost encouragement, training, guidance and excellent treatment by our Supervisor, Trainors, Lecturers and our co-OJT Trainees throughout our OJT journey.   ', 'NONE, talking about the least like about being in an FBS OJT program, I do not have something to mention for all the treatment and services we have witness and experience are all excellent.', 'NONE.', 'Maraming salamat po for welcoming us in your beloved company and letting us experience what it is to nurture and skills and personality towards the IT industry and in an Office settings. Maraming Salamat po and we are very grateful and proud po to be part of the FBS OJT PROGRAM.', '2023-05-24'),
(95, '1', 'mellgodwin.barza@g.batstate-u.edu.ph', '100', 'I like the most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is the training', 'None', 'The power shortage', 'None', '2023-05-24'),
(96, '1', 'realouise175@gmail.com', '91.11', 'Practical and knowledges that can be applied in real-life. The instructors are very diligent on the activities.', 'None', 'Variation of activities', 'None', '2023-05-24'),
(97, '1', 'krishnarozel.hernandez@g.batstate-u.edu.ph', '95.56', 'The program that I like the most is when they teach us on how to used the tailwind in order to convert our previous activity, the exciting part that I like in there is when the code is not working, I like it because it gives me more knowledge on how to fix it and I can say that, it runs because I do it on my own.', 'The least program that I like is the last program, wordpress using elements, because we are not be able to complete a one site as we don&#39;t have enough knowledge and time to know and explore it more.', 'As of now, I have nothing to say, As I can see the FBS OJT program have the most excellent and outstanding offer, other than company.', 'Thank you', '2023-05-24'),
(98, '1', 'allan.asican2702@gmail.com', '100', 'They will not move on from a next topic until all trainees have learned it.', 'none.', 'Perhaps they could incorporate some back-end teaching into the program/website.', 'none.', '2023-05-29'),
(99, '1', 'federioarjay16@gmail.com', '100', 'What i like the most in FBS is I highly appreciate the transparency of FBS as it enables open communication and clarity in their operations. Moreover, their dedication to sharing their vast knowledge and skills with us significantly contributes to our personal and professional development. ', 'Nothing ', 'I suggest to add another course which is react js.', 'Thankyou FBS for the knowledge and skills that I acquired. This will be my stepping stone to follow and continue my choosen field of work.', '2023-05-29'),
(100, '1', 'ajboy.arellano@gmail.com', '95.56', 'What I liked the most on FBS OJT Program is how hands-on the instructor were in teaching us the basic&#39;s and giving us the guidance and motivation to learn and finish our task. They may sure that we learned the skills needed for us to be equipped and learn how to code and design.', 'None I really enjoyed my time here at FBS.', 'I think FBS should reach out on more schools to offer their OJT Program.', 'I Hope FBS will help more students in developing their skills and attitude and be equipped to be ready to be part of the work-force.', '2023-06-05'),
(101, '1', 'gianmico07@gmail.com', '100', 'My favorite aspects of FBS OJT Program are the following: the instructors are kind and supportive, which helps us cope with stress. They also equip us with the necessary tools for website development. Moreover, they show great patience with us.', 'Nothing.', 'For now, I have no suggestions for that because everything seems pretty good to me.', 'Thank you, FBS. To be honest, my skills in HTML and CSS have improved. Before, I was so confused about how to properly code a style for my website, but now I get it. I do not regret that I am working here, even though there&#39;s a payment, but it&#39;s worth it. I will highly recommend this to my friends who are looking for an OJT.', '2023-06-05'),
(102, '1', '0319-2584@lspu.edu.ph', '100', 'What I liked the most about the FBS OJT Program are the  well-equipped trainer who never get tired of us trainees. I also liked the wordpress development where I learned how to convert html/css to wordpress. They also teach us how to be a good person. ', 'I can&#39;t think of anything.', 'I don&#39;t have any suggestions, because my experience here are incredible. ', 'Thank you so much FBS for the best Experience before I end my college life. Thanks to all the Instructors who taught us with  their very  best! God Bless FBS! ', '2023-06-05'),
(103, '1', 'rannielespinazxc@gmail.com', '100', 'I like how I can learn a lot every week and how patient the mentors are.', 'Without sugarcoating, I actually like everything I experienced here at FBS.', 'Maybe add more OJT training other than Web Development and Accounting.', 'None', '2023-06-06'),
(104, '1', 'simavegail09@gmail.com', '100', 'The coverage of the trainings; and the people of fbs na very considerate.', 'Siguro, yung fact na hindi ko macocover lahat ng dapat na topic kasi mas mauuna akong matapos sa kasabayan ko. ', '.', 'Thank you for the experience. ', '2023-06-06'),
(105, '1', 'balcitajericho9@gmail.com', '100', 'Designing in Figma and harnessing the power of Tailwind for my design projects brings me great satisfaction and fulfillment.', '  None', 'None', 'Thank you so much!', '2023-06-06'),
(106, '1', 'nikkabanz11@gmail.com', '100', 'You may learn a lot such as html saas, tailwind, how to convert github and wordpress, and also the instructors educate interns like us will continue to learn new things. It teaches you how to be a good employee at the company that you will join. These are some of the aspects of the FBS OJT that I found to be the most enjoyable.', 'In this regard, there is not a single aspect of the fbs&#39;s services that I dislike.', 'I hope that more of you will join the Face to face participation in frontline.', 'Thank you so much, fbs family, for taking interns like me. I have a lot to work on, and I&#39;ll keep that in mind until I join the company. More power and a job well done to you all.', '2023-06-06'),
(107, '1', 'arvincastillo77@gmail.com', '100', ' I really admire the friendly nature of the instructors here, and at the same time, they maintain a high level of professionalism. I also love using Tailwind! Such an amazing framework.', 'For the least like, I think it&#39;s the delay in announcements but this happens very rarely.', 'At first, I am very unskilled in using Figma and I have learned so much with Sir Roy in a span of only 1 week but for me, I think, 1 week isn&#39;t enough to fully understand all the Figma functions so I suggest adding another week so we can learn more.', 'The atmosphere at the FBS office is amazing because everyone gets along and enjoys working there. The positive vibes and teamwork create a happy environment where people can be creative and productive. It&#39;s a great example of a company where everyone feels valued and works together to achieve impressive things.', '2023-06-06'),
(108, '1', 'brucaldan@gmail.com', '100', 'What I like the most about the Fbs ojt program is teaching us not only the technical skills we need in the industry but also the proper character we must have when we enter the industry.', 'None', 'None', 'Free unli coffee is good for the employee :)', '2023-06-07'),
(109, '1', 'hvwoliveros@gmail.com', '95.56', 'The instructors. Aside from learning a lot from them, they treated me with mutual respect as if I&#39;m not a trainee in FBS. Along with the hard skills they I&#39;ve learned from them, they also imparted in me the importance of team work whenever someone in the meeting have error/s on their code, patience because not everyone has the same learning curve, and they made me realize that it&#39;s okay to not know everything, that we can ask for help and/or search online because the internet is a developer&#39;s friend!! ', 'It&#39;s not really a big deal but when they left us hanging in a way that we wait for someone to admit us on the meeting without knowing if there&#39;s power interruptions or meetings where the instructors need to attend.', 'In relation to my previous answer, communicate as soon as possible. Also, when teaching codes that are unfamiliar for the trainees like in WordPress, for me it&#39;s better to start with like a lesson or even just the syntax then explain how the code works rather than just making the trainees copy the codes. By this, it will be easier to understand and manipulate the codes in the future. But there were times that the instructor explained it to us, like what Sir Paul did in linking custom styles and js files. ', 'The FBS OJT program is very worth it. Thank you so much, FBS ♡', '2023-06-09'),
(110, '1', 'ajalcantara30@gmail.com', '100', 'Sobrang approchable ng instructor namin, pag may hindi kami naintindihan pinapaliwanag nya sa mas madaling paraan para maintindihan namin agad.\n', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2023-06-19'),
(111, '1', 'francesfeonag@gmail.com', '100', 'I appreciated the fact that the fbs ojt program provided the tools we used; all we had to do was learn what we needed to know.', 'None.', 'None.', 'None.', '2023-06-19'),
(112, '1', 'nobangot@gmail.com', '100', 'I liked that they do not only teach technical skills but also focus on building the character of the trainees.', 'None. I love everything about the FBS OJT Program.', 'I recommend focusing more on the marketing aspect of FBS OJT Program so you can help many more students online and offline to have a real world work related experience.', 'I&#39;m very thankful all FBS team members especially to Ms. Thea for being there throughout my OJT. You are all awesome people. Thank you very much for this wonderful experience and relationship with you.', '2023-06-21'),
(113, '1', 'audielorenz18@gmail.com', '100', 'the teaching because fbs train the student before they give them a project or activity they prepare the student to be ready in applying in other industry', 'i actually like everything in fbs ojt program because fbs really prepared a ojt training that will give student the right training that they need for working in IT industry', 'i have suggestions because the fbs give a great ojt experience to students and trainees', 'i would like to say thank you to the fbs for the ojt program that they provide because i gain a lot of knowledge from them and learn a lot in web development', '2023-06-22'),
(114, '1', 'cristinedevela584@gmail.com', '93.33', 'What I appreciate most about this OJT program is its emphasis on supporting students with ambitions in IT or any computer-related field. They provide valuable hands-on experience and guidance by offering real-life tasks that are directly relevant to the industry.', 'While the trainers in this OJT program possess knowledge and skills, their expertise in training is lacking. They face challenges in effectively conveying information. Nonetheless, the overall learning experience remains enjoyable, and I have acquired valuable skills and knowledge throughout the program.', 'I recommend offering extra training or assistance to the trainers to help them improve their teaching and communication skills. This could involve workshops, mentoring, or resources to enhance their ability to effectively explain concepts and engage with students. By investing in the trainers&#39; professional development, the program can be improved, resulting in a better learning experience for students.', 'As my time with your company comes to an end, I wanted to express my heartfelt gratitude for the opportunity to be a part of your OJT program. It has been an incredible experience, and I am truly thankful for the knowledge, skills, and professional growth I have gained during my time here. ', '2023-06-22'),
(115, '1', 'diegocantre007@gmail.com', '100', 'The one thing I like the most about my experience in this OJT program is that the instructors are very eager to and passionate in their teaching that allows every trainees here will have a experience that can be used in their future careers in the field of Information Technology.', 'If I were to have the least, it is the experience and their teaching because of the short amount of time that I stayed here. It feels like I want to learn more so the shortness of time.  ', 'I suggest that more fellowship that enables all the employees and the trainees to have a bonding.', 'I would like to have a more workspace.', '2023-06-30'),
(116, '1', 'bernadettenunez005@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the way they teach us, I&#39;ve learned many things especially in programming', 'none', 'none', 'Thank you for being part of my ojt.', '2023-06-30'),
(117, '1', 'cmarca01@gmail.com', '100', 'I like how planned they are when it comes to their training, the instructors are hands-on and very friendly. They really taught us the proper way when it comes to the corporate world.', 'To be honest their training is the best. So I do not have a say on this one :)', 'I would like to suggest is more on facility but overall I am delighted on my experience.', 'I just want to thank FBS Family especially to Web Team for welcoming us and guiding us throughout this journey. I will forever cherished this journey.', '2023-06-30'),
(118, '1', 'marcelocastanedaiii@gmail.com', '100', 'Good office environment and work ethics', 'none', 'expansion of training rooms and facilities', 'I would like to thank FBS for accepting me as one of the trainees here. This opportunity helped me to learn a lot and enhance my skills.', '2023-06-30'),
(119, '1', 'loraceliz20@gmail.com', '100', 'appearance, attendance, attitude, character, communication, cooperation, organizational skills, productivity, respect and teamwork', 'nothing. ', 'facility and aircon.', 'I highly recommended Frontline Business Solution for student who want to learn and explore more specially on web development.', '2023-06-30'),
(120, '1', 'migueldsales2001@gmail.com', '100', 'healthy office environment ', 'none', 'expansion of buildings and facilities so that FBS can give more opportunities for their future trainees and employee', 'I am incredibly grateful to Frontline Business Solutions (FBS) for building dreams for us IT students. The skills and knowledge I gained here are invaluable. I hope FBS receives the recognition it deserves and expands its facilities for future trainees and employees. (Swimming po tayo sa San Narciso hehe) ', '2023-06-30'),
(121, '1', 'chelsealipnica@gmail.com', '100', 'I love everything about FBS, especially the instructors who taught us and guided us in our OJT Journey. They treated us not just like a regular trainee/employee, but as a part of their FBS family. I felt their genuine love and care for everyone of us. I really liked their working environment because it was full of positive vibes and energy. It&#39;s really a healthy working environment. Also, I really loved the fact that they taught us well, from basics to advanced. Their way of training was very effective and very helpful for an OJT trainee like me. Overall, this OJT training is the most memorable college experience for me. Thank you FBS for making my OJT experience really worth it. ', 'none', 'I would like to suggest to have more OJT training facilities so that FBS can accommodate more students so that a lot of them can experience the greatness and expertise of FBS&#39;s Web Team and FBS employees. ', 'I hope I can come back here soon to train again with FBS. I hope this is not the end. Thank you very much FBS because I gained a lot of knowledge and skills which boosted my self confidence to jump into the real world.', '2023-06-30'),
(122, '1', 'lowrenceborja2116@gmail.com', '100', 'The Work Ethics and also the Facilities', 'none', 'More rooms and also Free Breads hehehe', 'Overall, my OJT experience exceeded my expectations. It provided me with an immersive learning environment, valuable connections, and the confidence to pursue my career goals with enthusiasm and determination. And also Can I kiss Again Sir Abeth:> yeeiiii I will miss you all FBS Web team Fam:', '2023-06-30'),
(123, '1', 'trishaamv.sayno@gmail.com', '100', 'I like everything here but what I liked the most were our instructors, they make sure that until the end of their interns&#39; OJT period, they make sure that all of their interns have a lot to learn. They shared and taught everything they knew. ', 'None. I like everything.', 'I think nothing needs to be improved.', 'I&#39;m so grateful that I&#39;ve found FBS. Thank you so much, FBS.', '2023-06-30'),
(124, '1', 'paulreyes644@gmail.com', '100', 'the work environment ', 'none', 'none', '-', '2023-07-14'),
(125, '1', 'christinevaldelacruz@gmail.com', '100', 'FBS OJT PROGRAM is very hands-on when it comes to teaching despite the fact that we are in a virtual set-up of the internship and even if you have zero knowledge in developing websites, you will feel not pressured in training. Friendly professionals.', 'NONE', 'NONE', 'Thank you po, sobrang daming knowledge po ang nadagdag po sa akin pagdating po sa front-end po thank you po', '2023-07-26'),
(126, '1', '20-03582@g.batstate-u.edu.ph', '100', 'I like the overall experience here in FBS Ojt Program. Also, the trainers are good and friendly. They taught us well and are approachable every time we asks questions. ', 'None. I really enjoyed my ojt experience here in FBS.', 'I can&#39;t think of some suggestions po because they&#39;ve really met my expectations.', 'Thank you po sa experience FBS. God Bless po.', '2023-07-27'),
(127, '1', 'christianjosephyao28@gmail.com', '100', 'Complete package learning about web development', 'None', 'None', 'None', '2023-07-31'),
(128, '1', 'ksumang77@gmail.com', '100', 'The training for professionalism and the pleasant environment', 'nada', 'Nothing, the service is good enough, I mean is the best that i have yet experienced.', 'God bless FBS', '2023-07-31'),
(129, '1', 'reyesallenhoward@gmail.com', '95.56', 'I like the wordpress lesson', 'Nothing cam to mind', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2023-07-31'),
(130, '1', 'cyrelljoyvertudes@gmail.com', '100', 'I like how the trainees teach us with indept knowledge in every part of the training. They always answer every question that we have in detailed.', 'Everything, but I like the fellowship every other month. ', 'Magdagdag ng ibang course like back-end, pero baka on the process na din yung back-end.', 'Wala naman po, thank you po sa experience and sa susunod ulit.', '2023-07-31'),
(131, '1', 'darrenicolas18@gmail.com', '100', 'i liked the way they teach. ', 'none', 'idk', 'none', '2023-07-31'),
(132, '1', 'mjbcapunitan@gmail.com', '100', 'My most favorite aspect of the ojt program is learning different approaches in creating a website and the sense of belonging withing the company.', 'none because i liked every aspect of our training here in FBS', 'The addition of backend would be amazing but overall, my entire experience has been excellent', 'I would like to say thank you to the whole company for the amazing experience that we had inside the ojt program, every expectation that I had was exceeded', '2023-07-31'),
(133, '1', 'samillanotrisha768@gmail.com', '95.56', 'I like the most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is the company fellowship and how each of the employee care about each other and the leaders.', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2023-07-31'),
(134, '1', 'agq.xyz@gmail.com', '97.78', 'I liked most the personal leadership effectiveness lesson about the philosophy of web design as I learned the deeply thought out ideas of proper web user interfaces. ', 'Nothing. Everything was great.', 'The OJT Program was great and to be honest the only reason we did not study jaavascript as much was because of our limited 250 hours training time.', 'None', '2023-07-31'),
(135, '1', 'kentmathewenriquez@gmail.com', '100', '\nEnjoyable Environment\nThe instructors are easy to approach\nPersonal Leadership Effectiveness\nDevotion\nFellowship\n', 'none because it is an enjoyable experience.', 'none because everything is perfect.', 'I would like to thank the company for letting us experience the training.', '2023-07-31'),
(136, '1', 'jessealintanahin@gmail.com', '100', 'All of programs', 'None', 'n/a', 'n/a', '2023-07-31'),
(137, '1', 'gabrielperezmercado91@gmail.com', '100', 'Friendly mentors and the training', 'CR sa 2nd floor', 'Add more programs like backend, database and etc.', 'Everything is good! would recommend it to others.', '2023-07-31'),
(138, '1', 'allen_vince_victorio@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'what I liked most about the program was not only how we learned so much from the courses and the programming that was taught to us but also the people around us how supportive the teachers and the leaders to us. When there are questions they answer and try to figure out the solution with you as stated on the company name Frontline Business Solutions.', 'What I liked least about the program is how short it is. How we cant spend more time learning effectively due to the limitations in time and classes. ', 'None', 'I accumulated a lot of things from learning in coding values in life and a chronic addiction to caffeine. ', '2023-08-21'),
(139, '1', 'rubspalo@gmail.com', '100', 'FBS OJT Program helped me/us to enhance our skills with the guidance of highly skilled mentors, With their guidance they successfully taught us all the materials we need for our future careers. The environment is very friendly.', 'None', 'N/A', 'None', '2023-08-21'),
(140, '1', 'christian_yves_cornejo@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'The work environment was very welcoming and was what I liked the most about the company.', 'None', 'To try and collaborate or partner with our school De La Salle Lipa.', 'Wished I could have extended longer my internship.', '2023-08-21'),
(141, '1', 'rodmaron_recinto@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'The most I like about the FBS OJT program is that they handle every trainees very well. ', 'None', 'None', 'None', '2023-08-21'),
(142, '1', 'christian_jason_beloso@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'I like how we were taught, it wasn&#39;t fast paced, we would wait on someone if they were behind but we still made a lot of process during the whole training. ', 'None', 'I think that the FBS OJT Program is already effective as it is, the only suggestion I can think of is just be consistent and keep connecting with the trainees', 'Overall, The experience I had in FBS is great because there wasn&#39;t a day I did not learn a new thing, It was very exciting yet challenging. ', '2023-08-21'),
(143, '1', 'rsslbnvj@gmail.com', '100', 'What I like the most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM, is that how good are the instructors are, in addition to that the working environment is very comfortable you do not feel the pressure not like any normal companies.', 'NONE.', 'For me  the FBS OJT Program is already outstanding, the program helped me a lot.', 'FBS helped me a lot, not just in improving my skills and knowledge about web developing but also FBS helped me develop personal skills or soft skills.', '2023-08-21'),
(144, '1', 'brandon_mark_cantos@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'Healthy workplace and conducive environment for learning and productivity.', 'None', 'None', 'Positive workplace!', '2023-08-21'),
(145, '1', 'ryle_andrei_cabudol@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'The way the lessons are taught in a very understandable manner by instructors who are highly capable of teaching and getting along with the students.', 'None.', 'None.', 'Please keep providing valuable knowledge to students who want to learn web development.', '2023-08-21'),
(146, '1', 'bryan_dimaano@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'The most I like about FBS OJT PROGRAM is the curriculum they offer to students that are eager to learn and improve their skills in programming. I also like the community because they are welcoming.', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'I like to commend FBS family because they taught us many things that we can apply in the future and we also develop our skills in coding and how to work together.', '2023-08-21');
INSERT INTO `fbs_lcss_admin_evaluation` (`evaluation_aid`, `evaluation_list_id`, `evaluation_trainee_email`, `evaluation_trainee_ratings`, `evaluation_question_most`, `evaluation_question_least`, `evaluation_question_improve`, `evaluation_question_others`, `evaluation_created`) VALUES
(147, '1', 'marc_ysrael_maulion@dlsl.edu.ph', '100', 'What I like the most with FBS OJT Program is that they incorporate not only technical skills, but also with PLEs, which are discussions about personal improvement or development. The environment within this program is very welcoming. No individual is left behind.', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2023-08-21'),
(148, '1', 'lakatigbak31@gmail.com', '100', 'What I like most about the On-the-Job Training is the healthy environment of the company. I love how positive the employees are, seeing their smiles from morning until the end of the day spreads positivity to everyone. I also like their way of teaching, which creates no pressure on the trainees, resulting in less stress, and more knowledge.', 'N/A', 'I have no suggestions for improvements but I&#39;m wishing all the best for this company. I am beyond grateful that I have been part of this company for about a month and a half.', 'N/A', '2023-08-21'),
(149, '1', 'sayaomarkisrael@gmail.com', '100', 'First is the people, who passionate on teaching us about their expertice. Second is the type of training that prepares me for my future careers in a more practical and immersive manner, and last, the professional approach of teaching can also contribute to a more structured and effective learning experience.', 'For me only, I guess the fast phase of teaching, but I know, I need to practice more to cope with the lesson.', 'My suggestion, is to have a training at night, because some people who wants to try this training and learn how to code, but unfortunately they don&#39;t have free time at morining.', 'Thank you for allowing us to learn from your training. Thank you very much.', '2023-10-13'),
(150, '1', 'cpe.cruz.marklester@gmail.com', '100', 'Its project based training that makes the learning more engaging.', 'In my experience in the training, I enjoyed every part of it.', 'Sometimes the TV display is crashing which interrupts the training.', 'Overall, the training is excellent and the trainers really assisted us in every part of the program. ', '2023-10-13'),
(151, '1', 'comendadorj2prime@gmail.com', '100', 'They are very approachable and caring, so we are not affraid for some mistakes', 'Nothing.', 'Just continue worhiping god', 'Thankyou for supporting and encouraging us every single day. ', '2024-01-18'),
(152, '1', 'jerome.geronimo609@gmail.com', '100', 'The trainers is having an effort for us to improve, during the immersion program.  And it really help us to be more focus on task we do.', 'Nothing', 'Nothing', 'Nothing', '2024-01-18'),
(153, '1', 'aerolcamitan@southlakesis.ph.education', '100', 'I learned a lot of things that I can use in my real life.\n', 'super cold hehe.', 'Just continue the hard work and always trust god\n\n', 'I LOVE FBS!!!!!! ', '2024-01-18'),
(154, '1', 'jaekhob495@gmail.com', '88.89', 'I was able to learn about the working environment and gained a lot more knowledge of what is like to work. Also, how to behave professionally in both work life and personal life.', 'cold room\n', 'I would suggest to keep being innovative.\n', 'Thank you to all the trainers, staff and heads of FBS for the opportunity\n', '2024-01-18'),
(155, '1', 'lanceriveraa015@gmail.com', '100', 'The most OJT Program that I like the most is they teaching us to be discipline because of the policies here in FBS. ', 'Nothing, because I see FBS as good company', 'Nothing ', 'Ms. Herlyn helps me to improve our public speaking also my english speaking and I learn a lot to Ms. Herlyn. Ms. Thea teach us how to do accounting and she help us to improve our computer skills. Sir. Ansbert really thoughts us about life and attitude which is makes a big impact to our life. ', '2024-01-18'),
(156, '1', 'clarencecaya@southlakesis.ph.education', '100', 'nagugustuhan ko ay madami akong natututunan araw-araw at tinuturing kaming isang miyembro o pamilya ng isang Frontline Business Solutions Inc.', 'nothing', 'para saken ang maiimprove pa ng kumpanya na ito ay kung mas kukuha or maghihire pa sila ng mga ojt trainees dahil dito mas magkakaroon sila ng panibagong ideya mula dito.', 'This company helps us to improve our knowledge and skills for preparing our future jobs, and this company teaches me how to discipline myself and my time management. I love the way our mentors gave us the same treatment as others. I am so thankful that I have an opportunity to work with this company. In this company l gained a lot of experience that will help me to boost my confidence.\n', '2024-01-18'),
(157, '1', 'johnsuministrado@southlakesis.ph.education', '100', 'I like the attitude of the employees.', 'Nothing', 'Nothing', 'I’m really thankful and grateful for having a trainors like Ms. Herlyn, Ms. Thea, Sir. Jhonny and especially Sir. Ansbert, because they gave me a chance to work in this company in 10 days, and in the past few days I learned how to create emails that Ms. Herlyn taught me. I was blessed to have a trainor like her and very approachable to boost my confidence for being a student. Especially this company teaches us to wear formal attire and I loved the way how they loved the trainees and especially the way how they teach us to have a good manners and how to have a better life.', '2024-01-18'),
(158, '1', 'gomezericka1603@gmail.com', '93.33', 'The most I like in FBS as an intern is we really  practice our professionalism and work ethics, also the characters of the employees.', 'None po.', 'None, just be consistent po.', 'none ', '2024-01-19'),
(159, '1', 'ivandevera@southlakesis.ph.education', '77.78', 'designing at figma', 'coding at vs code', 'i have nothing more to add because for me, fbs&#39; ojt program were good', 'none', '2024-01-19'),
(160, '1', 'angelicacruda9@gmail.com', '88.89', 'I like how kind all the trainor&#39;s here even though the policy are very strict. They are all welcoming and approachable. ', 'Least related to my course.', 'I suggest to teach not just only about technical skills or program or web designing but also different jobs or courses.', 'I am still thankful to fbs because i learned a lot.', '2024-01-19'),
(161, '1', 'ethanveridiano@southlakesis.ph.education', '91.11', 'the tasks were difficult but they were very enjoyabl', '.', 'no suggestions, everything was great', 'none', '2024-01-19'),
(162, '1', 'banlatgabriel@gmail.com', '100', 'What i like the most here in FBS is that they would not only focus on improving our technical skills but they would also help us develop our soft skills during PLE Session. Honestly, PLE helps me to gain my confidence back.', 'Nothing. I like everything here in FBS. People/ Employees here  are very friendly.', 'i dont know what actually i should suggest because for me everything here is perfect. From the Training outline to how my mentor deliver the topic is a chef&#39;s kiss.', 'Nothing. I&#39;m just thankful that i did my intership here. It is my greatest investment in my life so far. Heart Heart FBS!!!', '2024-02-06'),
(163, '1', 'pedrescharles0713@gmail.com', '93.33', 'The Figma, HTML, and CSS', 'Nothing', 'Perfect napo wala na need na iimprove', 'Thank you po sa pa kape and sobrang lamig na room! 3>', '2024-02-16'),
(164, '1', 'npaduledward@gmail.com', '93.33', 'Figma, HTML, and CSS.', 'P.L.E', 'Nothing.', 'Thank you so much po sa solid na experience.', '2024-02-16'),
(165, '1', 'jerrisonsalva69@gmail.com', '82.22', 'I like the place of their company and the environment and the free coffee ', 'the close fitted entrance and exit of the company', 'make the facilities clean and the playground  ', 'FBS company is good and perfect company in  this ojt', '2024-02-16'),
(166, '1', 'alessiamayuga@gmail.com', '84.44', 'i liked our subject PLE, it taught me a lot of things in life', 'the codes are not my thing yet i know the knowledge i acquired would help me in the future.', 'N/A', 'n/a', '2024-02-16'),
(167, '1', 'aianaorfanel@gmail.com', '100', 'In the FBS OJT PROGRAM, I really how professional yet friendly environment of them. I never get shy and uncomfortable asking about things and they answer me without hesitations.', 'I don&#39;t like it when numerous codes are presented and I don&#39;t know what to do.', 'There is nothing that I would suggest to improve the program, because this program gives us what we need and fulfill our needs.', 'I would like to say that this program really helps me to be discipline, punctual and improves my work ethics, especially my professionalism. I would also like to thank every trainers and staffs of this company for helping us improve what we need to improve and teaching us WOW (words of wisdoms) that we will surely treasure and comprehend. ', '2024-02-16'),
(168, '1', 'Marklouiemanila29@gmail.com', '82.22', 'i like the PLE and how they treat us', 'N/A', 'the CR, because lack of tissue and other important in CR', 'N/A', '2024-02-16'),
