(171, '1', 'lieandominicr@gmail.com', '100', 'i gained a lot of knowledge about programming. This work immersion enlightens me on how a program is created and how it works. The knowledge i gained from this work immersion will be useful for my future.  My computer skills also improved a lot because of the work immersion which is very beneficial for my future', 'I have none ', 'The FBS OJT PROGRAM is already at its best for me', 'Thank you for the very heart warming treatment the FBS give us. ', '2024-02-16'),
(172, '1', 'sibayaneduardandreimaruquez@gmail.com', '93.33', 'yung kape po na libre any time po eh pede kumuha', 'yung room po kasi ang lakas po ng aircon at ang linis den po', 'none', 'none', '2024-02-16'),
