(174, '1', 'kentashleymillar@gmail.com', '95.56', 'i like how they treat their students and trainee, they&#39;re easy to approach and very friendly.  I like the free coffee and the environment in this company. ', 'The distance from my house. it&#39;s not that i don&#39;t like it, but i&#39;m not used to it, because i don&#39;t usually travel too far.', 'I can&#39;t think of anything to suggest, because for me, this company is the best. ', 'thank youuu so so so muchhh FBS! I learned a lot! ', '2024-02-16'),
(175, '1', 'jmrielle23@gmail.com', '80', 'in the span of 2 weeks in our immersion,  i really love our PLE subject after coding hours. it makes me feel so loved and  it can change our mindset and to be open to other perspectives. Another one is the coffee. ', 'n/a', 'n/a', 'i would like to appreciate all the trainers for us, especially ma&#39;am herlyn and sir ansbert. thank you for guiding us. i hope that we can see you all again. thank you!', '2024-02-16'),
(176, '1', 'louise.minton25@gmail.com', '91.11', 'I like it that I had a chance to do something I never even thought of doing, and I like how the instructors are really patient with us when coding. I also like how everyone is friendly even the students.', 'The least I like is the comfort room in the third floor since there is only 1 working cubicle and the only way to close it is using a curtain.', 'I suggest to fix the comfort room in the said floor, nothing else other than that.', 'none', '2024-02-16'),
(177, '1', 'angeljaninemolina30@gmail.com', '82.22', 'I like how professionals the employers are and how they treat interns inside and outside the company. The environment is relaxing, the food in cafeteria is worth the price, the whole place is hygienic, people are all nice and kind.  I enjoyed coding and making different web pages. It amazed me in a way that I can easily see the progress or result of my work. I&#39;ve learned a lot in this company, and I would like to go back here soon to gain more knowledge. Some of my understanding will definitely help me in the future. And lastly, the PLE. This is one of my favorite part of the day because after being stressed in coding, yung mga lessons po at topics ay talagang relate ako, and nakatulong din po siya in a way na unti-unting nababago yung pananaw ko sa ibang bagay. Unti-unti kong nababago yung ibang ugali ko na alam kong hindi maganda at nakakaapekto sa ibang tao. ', 'Doing responsive in websites. I find it hard to understand how to adjust different codes and how it actually works. It is not easy to figure out what you are going to do. It&#39;s fun yet challenging.', 'Yung mga cubicle po na walang door. Mas convenient if magagamit lahat. ', 'Thank you, FBS for having us. My experience here is unforgettable, especially the relationship I made with the instructor. Will definitely miss ', '2024-02-16'),
(178, '1', 'denizemontecillo06@gmail.com', '93.33', 'What I like the most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is the facilities.', 'What I like least about FBS OJT PROGRAM is the task that I cannot do it quickly.', 'N/A', 'Improvement ng cr like pintuan or some taklob especially for girls.', '2024-02-16'),
(179, '1', 'quitemarkfernan@gmail.com', '86.67', '.', '.', '.', '.', '2024-02-16'),
(180, '1', 'chryztellemaeraning@gmail.com', '97.78', 'The workers here, especially the people who taught us on having the knowledge of using computers.', 'My experience of being a slow learner when it comes to computers.', 'The only problem that i want them to take an action is about their comfort room. Some of them does not have doors.', 'I don&#39;t have any problems about this company, all I know is that I enjoyed being a trainee for 10 days even I faced a lot of challenges.', '2024-02-16'),
(181, '1', 'jadeallexarafa@gmail.com', '91.11', 'What I liked the most is when I learned a lot of things especially in making websites and along with the topics in our PLE. ', 'The least that I like is when I&#39;m having trouble in coding.', 'I suggest nothing based on my experience FBS OJT  PROGRAM. The company gave us lots of learnings with the help of our trainers.', 'I am very thankful that FBS welcomed us with open arms and that they teach us patiently.', '2024-02-16'),
(182, '1', 'mycasamson34@gmail.com', '97.78', 'Ang pinakanagustuhan ko po about dito is how the trainer are very effective on teaching us about website. Aside from that, hindi lang tungkol sa website ang kanilang tinuturo, pati na rin tungkol sa buhay which is motivating me.', 'Yung cr po na walang pinto huhu', 'N/A', 'I am grateful to have an experience here in FBS, I really enjoyed and learned a lot. I enjoyed staying here not just because of aircon, but because of pleasant environment. Thank you for all your services.', '2024-02-16'),
(183, '1', 'ruzzelshanecalinawan@gmail.com', '97.78', 'Yung sobrang babait po na trainors, because sobrang friendly po nila.', '-hallway\n-rooms\n-unli coffee\n', 'sorry po, pero yung cr po huhuhuhu', 'siguro po, if ever na papasukin kopo ang IT industry, i prefer po na dito mag wrok.', '2024-02-16'),
