(185, '1', 'ojp2000ortega@gmail.com', '77.78', 'the most thing that i like is the facilities', 'the cr is so clean and all the students and teachers are so kind', 'i would like to improve the canteen because it so hot inside', 'i would like to thanks to all the staff, teachers, and kat manong guard na napaka babait', '2024-02-19'),
(186, '1', 'gabionmatthew33@gmail.com', '88.89', 'i like how the instructors are approachable and the environment is not toxic.\n', 'The bathroom because it&#39;s still under develop', 'nothing, i like everything the way it is and i&#39;d say that this will be a good company for those who really want to pursue programming', 'none', '2024-02-19'),
(187, '1', 'guevarrakerby162@gmail.com', '95.56', 'The environment and the energy of the employee here at the company', 'Nothing', 'Nothing', 'Thank you for the opportunity that your company gave I will never forget the 10 days that we stay from here', '2024-02-19'),
(188, '1', 'jasminezhainegutierrez@gmail.com', '86.67', 'i like how the people in FBS program were approachable and helpful and most especially how they value each other\n', 'actually, i like everything here in FBS program, the only thing i don&#39;t like is the task we were doing because i am honestly not interested in anything that&#39;s related to computer', 'i would like to suggest  that the task they should assign to the future FBS OJT programs is the task that the intern  would like ', 'none', '2024-02-19'),
(189, '1', 'leemagno9@gmail.com', '97.78', 'what I like the most in FBS is doing a website through figma , I enjoy doing this because it helps me to gain a lot of knowledge.', 'NONE', 'NONE, because I really enjoying my 10days staying at FBS and also FBS has a good staff ', 'NONE', '2024-02-19'),
(190, '1', 'Ambongmarc2@gmail.com', '95.56', 'for me i ang nagustuhan kopo is ung environment the students inside the building is very polite and laging ansaya and nakikipag interact sometimes samen and lalo napo ung fun with our trainers special mention to sir roy and sir ansbert kasi for me ang trato nila samen is hindi lang student nor hindi lang den family ngunit sariling mga kaibigan naren nila and dun palang kitang kita kona and panalo na panalo napo ang fbs for me sa lahat ng larangan ng immersion ', 'for me wala naman po kasi lahat ng ginawa namen is very fun po kahit na mahirap but nakaka enjoy po because of the approach na binibigay samen ng trainers po namin', 'STRONG INTERNET CONNECTION', 'i am very honored na nag karon po ako ng chance para maka experience ng gantong immersion and i am very happy na madame akong nka close na mga trainers po namin especially po kay sir roy and sir ansbert for me da best po sila mag turo no lie po un lang hihi', '2024-02-19'),
(191, '1', 'biancamchy@gmail.com', '100', 'The thing I like the most is having PLE, rather than only learning or gaining knowledge about computer related skills, I like how this company teaches and guides us on how to be professional in work.', 'I think I don&#39;t have anything in particular that I like the least.', 'I would appreciate if PLE won&#39;t be removed and kept in the future., other than that, I have no suggestions.', 'I would like to thank you for giving us the opportunity to be able to participate in this OJT Program. I have learned a lot that I know would help me in future, specifically in college and when I would work.\n', '2024-02-19'),
(192, '1', 'deniramacahiya@gmail.com', '91.11', 'what i like the most in FBS OJT PROGRAM is figma, because i really enjoy designing a webpage, also how the staff communicate with me, they are just so kind and approachable.', 'none.', 'none, because i really enjoy my 10days stay here at fbs, i learn a lot and i also improve my communication skills.', 'none.', '2024-02-19'),
(193, '1', 'ryandelabellada26@gmail.com', '93.33', 'The environment', 'wala po, kasi sobrang nag enjoy po ako sa work immersion kahit na sstress po minsan sa pag ccode', 'strong internet connection', 'Thank you po sa magandang experience♥', '2024-02-19'),
(194, '1', 'johnmichaelmabilangan@gmail.com', '93.33', 'The most i like about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is that the learn process in here is more friendly since the trainer doesn&#39;t  pressure as alot while we staying for less than 10 days', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2024-02-19'),
(195, '1', 'aalapaolo@gmail.com', '91.11', 'I like the most when We are creating a Web Design, it&#39;s kind a hard  but it is also helpful for me. This OJT program helps me to enhance my computer skills.', 'Wala naman po because lahat po ng gusto ko matutunan ay  ko nakuha ko po dito.', 'the enough time for lunch and break time.', 'Madami po akong natutunan sa program po na ito and it&#39;s very helpful for me.', '2024-02-19'),
(196, '1', 'ashleyguevarra313@gmail.com', '93.33', 'What I like the most about our FBS OJT PROGRAM is that I experienced being surrounded by professionals and I love how the workplace can be comfortable and dynamic. I also like that I learned how to do programming and design my own web page which I didn&#39;t expect that I will enjoy it all through out my Work Immersion. Thank you, FBS, for making me experience things that before I didn&#39;t know I can. Thank you for being part of my stepping stone to college before finishing Senior High School.', 'To be honest, I don&#39;t have any least that I like, everything in this company made me excel on computer skills.', 'NONE', 'None, thank you!', '2024-02-19'),
(197, '1', 'buenafebridgetgaile@gmail.com', '95.56', 'They guided us throughout our stay here and they&#39;ve teach us on how to design a web page and also how to code.', 'None', 'The supervisors should teach the students ng hindi masyadong mabilis pero hindi rin mabagal especially beccause it was their first time and also because there are some students na naiiwan ng lesson because  super bilis magturo ng ibang supervisor.', 'Nice working envronment.', '2024-02-19'),
(198, '1', 'chaveznathaniel090@gmail.com', '75.56', 'the most i like about fbs ojt program is gaining more knowledge one example is in basic coding.', 'In FBS OJT PROGRAM ,i like their good approach on us and their good person on us.', 'none,because this ojt program is perfect even my course is not related in this ojt', 'none\n', '2024-02-19'),
(199, '1', 'javierdaniel1125@gmail.com', '95.56', 'I like the instructors the most in FBS because of their professionalism and the way they treat us', 'the least thing I like about the FBS program is the rest room in the third floor because it is still not finished and provides little privacy ', 'There wasn&#39;t any suggestions that I can think of, other than the third floor rest room still not being finished. If that was done, then everything is perfect for me ', 'Overall the program was enjoyable. Everyone was nice, the facilities were great and I learned so much in the small amount of time we are in here', '2024-02-19'),
(200, '1', 'danicagracedeleon@gmail.com', '91.11', 'I always feel a healthy environment in this industry . The trainers are great, very approachable, and kind to us (interns). Whenever we meet them, they know how to greet back with a smile on their faces even if they don&#39;t know us. Their positive attitude towards us influenced us to improve more and boost our confidence and communication skills. No lies, I really really love this place and I&#39;ll never forget this experience. ', 'Nothing, because this is the best!', 'Maybe the internet connection.', 'Thank you so much FBS fam for having us to experience your healthy and happy environment. I&#39;m glad to meet amazing and kind people (Sir Ansbert, Sir Roy, and Sir Jhonny). Thank you so much! Hoping that we can meet again when I get my college degree.', '2024-02-19'),
(201, '1', 'maryelaquinooo@gmail.com', '100', 'What I liked the most in FBS OJT PROGRAM was the professionalism of the environment and especially the smoothness of teaching and I really learned a lot in 10 days of training.', 'What I didn&#39;t like was the comfort room had no doors and always out of order.', 'Strong internet connection and doors in every cubicle.', 'none', '2024-02-19'),
(202, '1', 'queenruecell@gmail.com', '86.67', 'The things i like most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM are being with the trainers or staff, they treat us right whish helps us to continue and not to be discouraged by the challenges we face.', 'i think none.', 'i suggest to continue they are doing , because it can help a lot of students to improved our different skills specialy on how to communicate and respect others.', 'i think none.\n', '2024-02-19'),
(203, '1', 'melleitt1515@gmail.com', '97.78', 'What I enjoy most about FBS OJY PROGRAM is that it provides a high-quality work atmosphere while motivating and assisting others in completing tasks.', 'There&#39;s nothing about FBS that I dislike.', 'I propose that the internet connection be upgraded to enable all students to easily catch up.', 'I would want to express my gratitude to FBS for helping me become a better person by providing me with experiences that I will cherish and always remember, for providing me with extra knowledge that will be useful in the future, and for teaching me how to conduct myself professionally in the workplace.', '2024-02-19'),
(204, '1', 'samanthacuesta26@gmail.com', '82.22', 'I like how they approach and teach us as a real employees, I also like how they make sure that everyone can keep up with their tasks and discussions. And lastly how they make us feel comfortable in a very short time  but at the same time learn things and values that is not just about computer and ict but things that we can use to improve our perceptions,behaviours, and thinking that will surely help us to achieve our goals in the future.', 'in my 10days stay here in fbs I dont really encounter things that I dislike or didn&#39;t like. I really think that fbs is a perfect place to start building and learning about our future.', 'I suggest that they improve the comfort room. since trainers stays morethan 8hrs here a day. ', 'i dont really have any other comments, but I am indeed pleased and impressed about the learning, environment and professionalism of our trainers and the welcoming attitude of other employees here in fbs.', '2024-02-19'),
(205, '1', 'robertlitargo15@gmail.com', '88.89', 'in the FBS OJT PRGRAM i like how they deal with other people and then how they value each other.', 'what i didn&#39;t like about FBS OJT PROGRAM was the internet because when we were working the internet went down.', 'The problem I see with our FBS OJT PROGRAM is weak internet, maybe because of the number of computer connected, so i suggest adding internet.', 'none', '2024-02-19'),
(206, '1', 'aerondailarriola11@gmail.com', '93.33', 'what I like the most here is their teaching and dealing with students with respect and they&#39;re very kind', 'nothing', ' probably the internet connection', 'i will miss the people here and my work immersion session', '2024-02-19'),
(207, '1', 'justinemalabuyoc1@gmail.com', '93.33', 'ang nagusutuhan kopo sa fbs ijt program ay ang pagiging mabait at madaling lapitan po ang mga teacher at komportable po kami na makpag uusap sak naila', 'none', 'NONE', 'i would like to say that this program is full of love.Also fbs helps me to improve my self not only on skills in computer, it helps me to improve my personality.', '2024-02-19'),
(208, '1', 'alisonmaliksi07@gmail.com', '82.22', 'Besides on the learnings or knowledge that the program gave me, what I like the most are the people that I&#39;ve encountered.', 'none', 'none', 'I would like to say that I hope that they will treat the others the way they treated us and we&#39;re so thankful to get taught by them.', '2024-02-19'),
(209, '1', 'maryaldrinnejenica@gmail.com', '97.78', 'the cafeteria and the comfort room there because of the electric fan,, also the overall experience that I gain here from day 1 up until today', 'the pantry because it only has coffee, i dont drink coffee that&#39;s why i rarely go in the pantry', 'none', 'Ang ganda po ni Ms. Thea hehehe', '2024-03-07'),
(210, '1', 'belenjamea@gmail.com', '100', 'The things that I like the most are the cafeteria, their comfort room in the cafeteria, their pantry, and how other staff treat the interns. I can say that they&#39;re welcoming and fun to be with. ', 'None because I really love my experience in FBS OJT program.', 'None.', 'I would like to suggest changing the curtains in the comfort room into black out curtains since it was uncomfortable to use the C.R with a see through curtains.', '2024-03-07'),
(211, '1', 'mrevocado@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'the lesson that i learned ', 'my least like in FBS OJT PROGRAM is the smoke in the morning', 'N/A', 'i like the place and the people and some student that we sometimes interacting with here and i enjoy my time here\n ', '2024-03-07'),
(212, '1', 'dadeomano@stms.ph.education', '95.56', 'The MAXIMIZERS Discussion, the workplace itself, and the environment. I did not expect that we will be having PLE topics, since most of the OJT Program only focuses on the skills that will be cultivated by the trainee. FBS also focuses in the behavior and leadership skills of the trainee and how can that be improved. ', 'Scheduling PLE Discussion when we are already in the momentum of doing the task.', 'Make PLE Discussions scheduled first, so that the trainers will have a lot of focus when doing their tasks, especially if it is kind of complicated to do.', 'None', '2024-03-07'),
(213, '1', 'premoyan@stms.ph.education', '100', 'I learned a lot of things about accounting even if I don&#39;t do accounting in the future, I still learned something', 'nothing', 'nothing', 'mamiss ko po kayo:) thank you po!', '2024-03-07'),
(214, '1', 'nlatayan@stms.ph.education', '77.78', 'The thing that I liked the most about FBS OJT PROGRAM is the  way they taught us how to be accountable in terms of many things and the best example of this is being on time and all of the things that we can learn in PLE that they discussed to us.', 'when I am not done yet and I still have time left to finish that certain task but they make us pass it already even if we are not yet done, and to those time that they are in a hassle in teaching the certain topic.', 'I suggest that they should improve more the way they teach their trainee and don&#39;t rush at the end.', 'none.', '2024-03-07'),
(215, '1', 'ltolentino@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'i learn more on how do we use excel', 'Smoke and being cold', 'n/a', 'i love the place, making friends and also doing some activities', '2024-03-07'),
(216, '1', 'zvargas@stms.ph.education', '100', 'the skill what they way to teach and to communicate each other', 'the technology, the teachers, and of course the all members of the frontline', 'to make a new building for shs and for jhs because the frontline is too excellent for teaching and its more than my expectation', 'i dont have any comments because frontline is too good to me and I have many learn for  college next school year', '2024-03-07'),
(217, '1', 'jmanato@stms.ph.education', '91.11', 'There are a lot of things that I like about the FBS OJT PROGRAM but what I like the most is that, FBS helped me to see potential on myself. I encountered a lot of things that seems scary to do due to lack of knowledge but FBS made me believe that all I have to do is to practice and believe in myself that I can do it. Also , those 10 busy days full of new activities will serve as a first step for upcoming big challenges. ', 'What I like the least about FBS OJT PROGRAM was I was so pressured to do the tasks because the given time was not enough for me to finish  those assigned works. However, even though that is what I like the least, it helps me to remind myself that I shouldn&#39;t waste my time and it also helps me to become aware that after college, there are more serious things ahead. ', 'Maybe to have more privacy for trainee&#39;s done activities. It is because from my experience, some of the trainees are cheating, copying someone&#39;s answers and get higher grade. It is so unfair because the tasks was so hard to  do and someone will just cheat. ', 'Thank you so much, FBS OJT PROGRAM! I appreciate everything^^', '2024-03-07'),
(218, '1', 'padarlo@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'PLE subject', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2024-03-07'),
(219, '1', 'xaustria@stms.ph.education', '100', 'I think that would be everything. I really liked the way the manage the program. I can say that this program helped me a lot in different ways. It didn&#39;t just taught me how to be a professional but also to become a better person. ', 'Nothing', 'I think it would be their time schedule in PLE. Sometimes, when I am doing an activity, I gain momentum in doing that particular activity and lose it in the process because of the sudden change of activity, which is the PLE subject. I think it would be nice if they had a specific time for the subject. ', 'Thank you so much po, FBS! I learned a lot from your program po. I will take those lessons with me ', '2024-03-07'),
(220, '1', 'kylanebreja44@gmail.com', '84.44', 'What I like the most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is that all the things you need is provided', 'What I like the least about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is that the trainees need to wear formal clothes every day', 'I suggest that they should make sure that the trainees understand what they are teaching so that no one is left out of the lessons', 'Nothing', '2024-03-07'),
(221, '1', 'francinelumanlan@gmail.com', '84.44', 'I liked the part where there is one PC used by each trainee. I also liked the location because it is peaceful and the classroom is very cold due to the high temperature of aircon.', 'Sometimes the internet connection gets weak.', 'I would like to suggest that the trainer teach and give more examples about the topic so that the trainee can understand more.', 'I feel more at home, more comfortable because we are sitting for like 8 hours straight (a day) and also because of the aircon.', '2024-03-07'),
(222, '1', 'kmantahinay@stms.ph.education', '100', 'the responsibility and being of everyone here and unity', 'the room is very cold', 'no suggestions', 'no comment', '2024-03-07'),
(223, '1', 'martinguinto25@gmail.com', '88.89', 'The coldness of the workplace.', 'Everything works okay.', 'None.', 'Maybe 7 am  is not suit for other people.', '2024-03-07'),
(224, '1', '22menolio@gmail.com', '95.56', 'The rules and the they teach clearly', 'The stricly in time ', 'more teacher ', 'One of the best', '2024-03-07'),
(225, '1', 'jmumali@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'May music habang nag gagawa ng mga tasks, astig at aesthetic.', 'Very cold inside the workplace.', 'I suggest to make  the ac less cold.', 'nothing.', '2024-03-07'),
(226, '1', 'jdagli@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'I personally like in here is that we got to practice our critical thinking skills and we literally gained knowledge that was aligned on our academic track and strand. I also like the PLE discussions because it makes you think, reflect, and motivate to the things going on with your life.\n', 'One thing that I actually least liked about our program here is that we don&#39;t got to see the errors that we had on the graded activity. It always leads to wondering too much.', 'Actually, in my experience, there is nothing that I could recommend for it to further improve but sometimes I cannot help but notice, few co-workers find it hard to apply the discussion that we had in the activity given, so to maybe improve it or lessen it, a thorough lesson of each activity is a good solution. Also, it was also going to be more okay if we see our mistakes on the graded activity because sometimes we or I am wondering how I got that grade; is there wrong with my output? is there errors?, that&#39;s the questions that I encounter to wonder.', 'Miss Thea is definitely an effective, considerate, and understanding trainer. FBS definitely made a right decision to hire her! I&#39;ll miss working here!', '2024-03-07'),
(227, '1', 'juliuspullo0@gmail.com', '93.33', 'I like about how they treat us, teaching us properly and nicely', 'About schedule being too early ', 'Free snacks, less cold of aircon, and about comfort rooms no doors', 'The place was nice and i feel comfortable', '2024-03-07'),
(228, '1', 'cbaradas@stms.ph.education', '100', 'I like about how they treated us, I didn&#39;t felt like we were strangers from them, the staffs and employees are so friendly and approachable. Also I learned so much about accounting, it was actually so hard but I learned.', 'Actually there&#39;s nothing I don&#39;t like about it or like least about them, it&#39;s just that sometimes the aircon is too cold and we&#39;re freezing hehehehehehe', 'I don&#39;t have any suggestions po hehehe', 'I hope everyone to be healthy, and to Ms.Thea thank you so much for teaching us, we learned so much from you and from other teachers. I wish you a happy life and a healthy baby :) :3', '2024-03-07'),
(229, '1', 'cavenido@stms.ph.education', '100', '\nI liked that they have a PLE that shows the importance of ourselves and many other things', 'I don&#39;t think there&#39;s anything I don&#39;t like, but maybe it just the high temperature of the air conditioner sometimes, and that makes my classmates feel uncomfortable', 'i don&#39;t have any suggestions to improve', 'Nothing but i want to say thankyou to All FBJ that teach us, And i wish a good health to miss thea&#39;s baby, Thankyou poo', '2024-03-07'),
(230, '1', 'lcruz@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'what I liked about fbs are the people who work there, because everyone is kind', 'the air conditioner is too cold', 'don&#39;t make the air conditioner too loud', 'that&#39;s all I want', '2024-03-07'),
(231, '1', 'mecapina@stms.ph.education', '97.78', 'I like the most in FBS program was how fun it made learning about accounting that enhance my understanding and preparing me for the challenges of the accounting field. ', 'I like the least in FBS program was probably the long journalizing. ', 'I have no suggestion on the program, my suggestion is to improve the facility like the comfort room.', 'None.', '2024-03-07'),
(232, '1', 'waweumali@gmail.com', '97.78', 'A LOT OF KNOWLEDGE', 'RHE TASK IS SLIGHTLY HARD AND CHALLENGING', 'ITHINK MY KNOWLEDGE ABOUT ACCOUNTING AND MORE KNOLEDGE', 'IM SO HAPPY BEACAUSE TO MY EXPERIENCE ABOUT FBS AND I LOT OF KNOWLEDGE ACTUALLY ', '2024-03-07'),
(233, '1', 'Idemesa@stms.ph.education', '73.33', 'what I like the most is about the PLE subject the instructor, might think that I didn&#39;t learn any. but to tell the truth I learned a lot, plus it made me realize a lot of things in real life', 'I think I don&#39;t have any. after all I like all the things about that I learned\n', 'I don&#39;t any, since it&#39;s all good :)', 'None', '2024-03-07'),
(234, '1', 'sheandazo18@gmail.com', '84.44', 'good service and good organizarion and good trainers', 'free coffee and music while doing the task\n', 'low the aircon ', 'i will miss this organization because this gave me knowledge that i need for the course i will get in college', '2024-03-07'),
(235, '1', 'dazojustine8@gmail.com', '73.33', 'Happy and enjoying the FBS OJT PROGRAM and music ', 'aircon, coffee', 'nothing\n', 'paninda po mahal', '2024-03-07'),
(236, '1', 'cheskayaminahf@gmail.com', '93.33', 'exploring real-world applications of concepts learned in class and gaining hands-on experience were the highlights of the FBS OJT program for me\n', 'nothing I guess', 'none', 'none', '2024-03-07'),
(237, '1', 'justinbaliwag20@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the most is the sense of belongingness and the trainers are open to questions and approachable.', 'I like the most is I learned many things and lessons during the immersion. It also introduced me to new programming languages.', 'It is already good, I just hope that they continue doing what they are doing.', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(238, '1', 'crasca143143@gmail.com', '66.67', 'The facility and the teaching methods', 'The rush work because of NAT', 'none', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(239, '1', 'annepenuliar017@gmail.com', '100', 'I like their workplace environment. ', 'That I cant come in FBS because of NAT.', 'Download gdrive.', 'I would like to stay here longer, but I am graduating today. Thank you for teaching me new skills, and I also enjoyed staying here^^', '2024-03-22'),
(240, '1', 'carldavidalba@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the way how they develop and improve the technical skills of their trainees.', 'I like all about FBS OJT PROGRAM because I learn more things about web design and web development by the help of this program.', 'None.', 'None', '2024-03-22'),
(241, '1', 'alvarezaliana27@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the most here in FBS OJT PROGRAM is how the ambiance is so peaceful and beautiful. The people in here are so welcoming, kind and very intelligent.', 'I like all of it in FBS OJT PROGRAM because of their sincereness in teaching to web development and web designing.', 'None.', 'Thank you so much FBS!! Without this company, I wouldn&#39;t know such many things about HTML, CSS, and Javascript. ', '2024-03-22'),
(242, '1', 'marcgianlagurin016@gmail.com', '86.67', 'The free unli coffee and the room and lastly the place', 'I gain so much knowledge in this community', 'CR hehe, because there is no door and videt it is difficult when planting hehe', 'nohthing mwehehe', '2024-03-22'),
(243, '1', 'dakristofferfr@gmail.com', '97.78', 'Definitely Sir Ansbert Gregana', 'the bathroom :(', 'bathroom and maybe better peripherals ', 'I enjoyed my stay in Frontline Business Solutions. I learned a lot in the span of 10 days and I really had fun while learning in this environment, at first I was nervous that I would not learn anything because I thought that I couldn&#39;t comprehend anything because it was only 10 days and only a short time but in the end I learned a lot about html, css ,js, and figma. Thank you FBS for teaching me and my classmates. And lastly many thanks to sir Ansbert for teaching us black magic and just being generally chill with his students. Again, thank you so much for the 10 days. ', '2024-03-22'),
(244, '1', 'aquinogabriellechristian@gmail.com', '100', 'the day when they teach us how to use figma', 'none', 'making sure that everyone are listening \n', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(245, '1', 'casilangjonas@gmail.com', '95.56', 'Our trainers specially sir Ansbrert Gregana. i also like their other employee they are very kind and their pantry', 'The bathroom has no door and i think the price in canteen is a bit overprice ', 'To improve their bathrooms', 'I enjoyed my stay here in Frontline business. I learned a lot of things in a short period of time. My stay here is definitely a good introduction for me in web development.', '2024-03-22'),
(246, '1', 'daphneapostol365@gmail.com', '100', 'What I like about FBS is the comfortable and nice workplace. The teachers here are approachable and helps you whenever you are in trouble in coding and other things.  The teachers teach well that I learned a lot of things.', 'None', 'I don&#39;t think there&#39;s no suggestions I like to make because I was satisfied with the service that FBS  gave to me', 'I love FBS :))', '2024-03-22'),
(247, '1', 'zairushmendoza@gmail.com', '75.56', 'their facilities and their provided equipment for trainees because it give us comfortable work experience', 'their response because sometimes it&#39;s delay but i understand it', 'none, because i like it though', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(248, '1', 'ronalynhila54@gmail.com', '73.33', 'what like the most about to FBS OJT PROGRAM the environment equipment', 'FBS OJT PROGRAM i like least about html  and web designing ', 'i want to improve my self like  to future  FBS PROGRAM  is web designing', 'i would like to express to sir ansbert gregana and maam herlyn mae torres the good teaching', '2024-03-22'),
(249, '1', 'bautistadancedric6@gmail.com', '88.89', 'The trainers are so skilled that I can make my own website because of them. And also the free coffee.', 'There&#39;s nothing I like the least in OJT program because I learned so many things about coding', 'I want to make improvements to the time limitation in every activity because students is not that good enough to finish the activity in short period of time', 'Thankyou FBS!', '2024-03-22'),
(250, '1', 'elihjah17@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the most in this program was the free coffee and also the super chill vibes of the trainers they maybe frustrated but they have a long patience, I will treasure everything especially the learnings I gain.', 'The professionalism of the trainers', 'I have nothing to suggest to the FBS  program I&#39;m really grateful to the warm welcome of the workers and the trainers\n', 'none\n', '2024-03-22'),
(251, '1', 'mendozafranzgian921@gmail.com', '88.89', 'i like the work place such a cool place to work in immertion', 'the comfort room like there no door on bawl', 'nothing just keep this algo so you can get a better results', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(252, '1', 'athina091203@gmail.com', '71.11', 'what I like the most about FBS OJT PROGRAM is their environment and staffs are very accommodating towards us + the unlimited coffee', 'I think I like the least is they are fast when their discussing i don&#39;t know if it is just me. Sometimes I couldn&#39;t just sabay sometimes', 'n/a', 'I would like to express my gratitude to our instructors Mr. Ansbert Gregana and Ms. Herlyne Mae Torres for teaching us web designing and web developing. I learned so many things about html, css, and javascript. I&#39;m hoping that I could use these learnings in the future. Thank u :>', '2024-03-22'),
(253, '1', 'trixiesimilla4@gmail.com', '80', 'The designing part using Figma and the multiple features you can add on your code', 'The coding part i guess..', 'longer timeeeee or days for immersion!!', 'I am grateful for this experience, though it was challenging on my part, I learned quite a lot.. THANK YOU!!', '2024-03-22'),
(254, '1', 'justineerickisleta@gmail.com', '93.33', 'The things that I like the most in FBS OJT PROGRAM is that the workplace is very comfortable and I gained a lot of knowledge that could help me in my future career in web development', 'The least that I like in FBS OJT PROGRAM is too cold', 'In my opinion I think there&#39;s no need to be improve', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(255, '1', 'jhadezymond05@gmail.com', '95.56', 'the fbs workers that are very active and kind. the workplace is good but it&#39;s too cold.', 'it&#39;s too cold on my place', 'none', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(256, '1', 'bdonnacristel@gmail.com', '100', 'The clean facilities and friendly instructors made it a great place to learn coding and get help whenever I needed it\n', 'when the instructor was fast when teaching code sometimes.', 'they have to upgrade the fbs site more', 'thank you Frontline business Solutions Inc, i gain more knowdelge in coding.', '2024-03-22'),
(257, '1', 'floresnathaniel792@gmail.com', '77.78', 'nagustuhan ko po mag ojt idto dahil maayos ang pag tuturo ng aming mga trainors, kahit hindi makasunod sa lesson pero tinuturun naman kamin ng mga trainors, bukod dito madami din akong naklala na empleyado', 'to be honest ang hinid ko lng po talaga nagustuhan or naiintindihan ng maayos ay sa part ng html at sa pag gagawa ng mga group sa figma', 'siguro po sa mga pc po dito na ginagamit namin dahil po napatapat po ako sa isang pc dito na mabagal mag run at sira sira po ang mouse pad', 'siguro po sa internet dahil minsan po ay nahina ang internet na ginagamit namin', '2024-03-22'),
(258, '1', 'jhonverph@gmail.com', '100', 'I really love the free coffee experience that shakes me to the core , and the air conditioned work environment that makes me feel comfy and cold, and the trainers that helped us  learn web developing.', 'I like the air conditioned room but sometimes it just get cold.', 'i don&#39;t really have much of an idea how it will improve, but  i think a private space or a work desk with borders to have more privacy and less distraction. its just my preferences since i want to be alone when do my task without distraction', 'Thank You so much for the great experience this program taught me, i was able to learn html and css and also FIGMA the sigma, ill make use of the the knowledge i gained here to invest for my future goal ', '2024-03-22'),
(259, '1', 'stephanielaviste9@gmail.com', '77.78', 'The work place', 'i gain knowledge', 'nothing', 'nothing', '2024-03-22'),
(260, '1', 'ranzelkian@gmail.com', '100', 'I like the work environment.  I comfortably sat while coding and listening to the lessons they teach. I also like the facilities most specifically where you can have coffee to feel energized during coding.', 'Although a comfortable work environment, The AC is too cold unless if you wear jacket. ', 'I suggest to have the temperature of the AC perfect for everyone.', 'I would like to have my greatest gratitude to have my work immersion here. I have learned  a lot of how to make a web development, and hopefully I can have a decision of my field of programming that I wanted to be in the future. Thank you again for having me here in Frontline Business Solutions and God Bless!', '2024-03-22'),
(261, '1', 'lindsaytolentino2@gmail.com', '100', 'the topic of html and css and creating of webpages', 'working place, work ethic and profesionalism ng facilitator', 'long hours for activity', 'none', '2024-03-22');
INSERT INTO `fbs_lcss_admin_evaluation` (`evaluation_aid`, `evaluation_list_id`, `evaluation_trainee_email`, `evaluation_trainee_ratings`, `evaluation_question_most`, `evaluation_question_least`, `evaluation_question_improve`, `evaluation_question_others`, `evaluation_created`) VALUES
(262, '1', 'kzed.austria@gmail.com', '95.56', 'i like how they teach us i like the facility                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     