                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ', 'sometimes i&#39;dont like programming because, i&#39;m not good at that, but its fun to try to learn ', 'i dont have suggestion cause its perfect the way of FBS programm', 'thank you for teaching us', '2024-03-22'),
(263, '1', 'princesschelseaaniciete@gmail.com', '100', 'i like their learning system', 'i gain knowledge', 'none', 'nothing', '2024-03-22'),
(264, '1', 'johndenvermalabanan@gmail.com', '68.89', 'i like the way the teacher teach', 'i don&#39;t like the work because it&#39;s hard\n', ' idon&#39;t have suggestions ', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(265, '1', 'lawrence06gading@gmail.com', '88.89', 'When our trainer is discussing, I think their explanation to the subject is so understandable', 'When they gave us some activities that are difficult to do', 'Nothing, I think there are no problems regarding their ojt, they gave us many breaks when we are exhausted from work', 'I will miss waking up early to attend our immersion here at fbs. I learned so many on our last 10  days and I am thankful for them because they teach me so much,', '2024-03-22'),
(266, '1', 'johnryguerra265@gmail.com', '97.78', 'employee is best treat to me and the room is so clean and cold', 'the chair is slippery and i always uncomfy to my chair', 'none', 'none', '2024-03-22'),
(267, '1', 'fjfrinzjohnzel@gmail.com', '77.78', 'What I liked the most about fbs is the ambiance here.', 'None, i love fbs ', 'None', 'I love FBS ', '2024-03-22'),
(268, '1', 'tristanjamestorres9@gmail.com', '100', 'what I liked the most about the FBS OJT PROGRAM is that It helped me learn new skills in  such a short time.', 'Nothing at all.', 'N/A.', 'Thank you for these 10 days, It really helped me learn new skills, I hope I could stay for a longer time.', '2024-03-22'),
(269, '1', 'aaroncarldiamond@gmail.com', '100', 'I like their work environment, I like how kind and patient the instructors with us. They gave us a very comfy workplace.', 'The least I like about FBS OJT program is how slow it goes when everyone gets delayed because of errors in their code, I feel bad for the instructors because they showed upmost effort, and we couldn&#39;t fully satisfy their expectations.\nall in all, there is nothing I do not like about FBS and their training programs', 'I think they should extend the time from 80 hours to 120 hours.', 'I have no comments in general, I just think that it&#39;s freezing while we work', '2024-03-22');
